OL,3,AI will make final decision on Rosebank
OL,4,Aoil field, energy secretary insists
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh has
OL,7,Finsisted she will make the final
OL,8,Fdecision over whether to approve the
OL,9,Fcontroversial Rosebank oil field, not
OL,10,Fthe prime minister or chancellor.
OL,12,FShe said there was a "tight" framework
OL,13,Finvolved in making the decision to
OL,14,Favoid it being overturned in the
OL,15,Fcourts, and she was the only one who
OL,16,Fcould make the final choice about
OL,17,Fwhether to give the scheme the
OL,18,Fgo-ahead.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
