OL,3,AI will make final decision on Rosebank
OL,4,Aoil field, energy secretary insists
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosebank, which is about 80 miles
OL,7,F(128km) north-west of Shetland, is
OL,8,FBritain's largest untapped oil field
OL,9,Fand would also produce some gas.
OL,11,FIt comes after the UK government
OL,12,Fapproved production from the Jackdaw
OL,13,Fgas field in the North Sea.
